# Design-system compose (MCP-only)

When user mentions **design-system-portal** or **«Через design-system-portal»** (with Figma URL and/or «собери макет»):

1. **MUST** use MCP `design-system-portal` → `composeUi` (Figma MCP first if URL).
2. **MUST NOT** hand-write HTML/Tailwind/generic React — Radix Themes is implied by MCP tools.
3. If MCP disconnected → tell user to connect it; **do not** fallback to manual markup.
4. Reply: TSX from `composeUi`. No files unless asked.

If user only says «Собери макет» without `design-system-portal` — suggest adding:
`Через design-system-portal`

Recommended user prompt (copy for testers):

```
https://www.figma.com/design/4Ja381GLnRb9WGULIpKhlV/Figma-to-Code?node-id=1-25110
Собери макет.
Через design-system-portal
```
